        <item>
            <title>Version 1.3.0</title>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>All-new Smoked Glass display design with three views: a hero card when events are imminent or live, a full-screen agenda during quiet stretches, and large welcome slides on empty days</li>
                    <li>eSpace's "Hide From All Digital Signage Displays" checkbox works again — hidden events stay off the screens (configure under eSpace Signage Sync in the web config)</li>
                    <li>Fixed events with room conflicts not appearing, and deleted events still showing</li>
                    <li>Stability: hardened against malformed requests and eSpace outages</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/NorthwoodsCommunityChurch/app-updates/releases/download/northwoodswayfind-v1.3.0/Northwoods-Wayfind-v1.3.0.zip"
