            <pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 17:15:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>New configuration web app — manage the API key, per-room displays, hidden events, and welcome slides from any browser on the network</li>
                    <li>Menu bar simplified to: Check for Updates, Open Configuration, Quit</li>
                    <li>Fixed Today's Events list clipping when full — long lists now page automatically</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
